  triage:title "docs/atm-core/boundaries.md InboxExport section not updated for Y.5 field-stripping" ;
  triage:description "The InboxExport section of docs/atm-core/boundaries.md documents the compat JSONL output contract but stops at Y.4 changes. It does not reflect the Y.5 removal of source_team, pendingAckAt, acknowledgedAt, acknowledgesMessageId, expiresAt, and metadata.atm.* from the compat output via strip_removed_compatibility_fields() and strip_metadata_atm_namespace(). Fix: update the InboxExport section to list the Y.5 field-stripping changes and reference inbox-field-inventory.md for the full disposition table." ;
